// Cursor AI Rules for Pico Flutter Monorepo
// For full project documentation, see CLAUDE.md in this directory.
// This file provides Cursor-specific directives.

// Architecture: Flutter monorepo with Dart workspace + Melos
// Patterns: API/Impl split, Dual-GetIt DI, feature manifest + lazy SDK, two-phase init
// Formatting: Always use `dart format`
// Commits: Conventional commit style
// DI: injectable + GetIt with microPackage pattern
// Testing: flutter test with coverage

// Key rules:
// - Never modify generated files (*.g.dart, *.module.dart, *.gr.dart, *.config.dart)
// - Always add newline at end of file
// - Use package imports, not relative imports in lib/
// - API packages (_api) are pure Dart and depend only on shared/dependencies_core
// - Run `dart analyze` after changes to catch issues
// - Run `dart format .` to format code

// Task guides (skills): .claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md, indexed in AGENTS.md.
// See CLAUDE.md for complete workspace structure, architecture patterns,
// DI patterns, key commands, and guides for adding features/infrastructure.
